{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"2f94c34a21c96afb2fa5dd31e916ecbe47a93a65b505dad02727f81d295816f4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["運回約櫃"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大衛跟千夫長、百夫長等所有的首領商議，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["然後對以色列全體會眾說：「如果你們贊成，而且如果這是我們上帝耶和華的旨意，我們就派人到以色列各地把其他同胞，包括住在城邑及草場的祭司和利未人召集來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我們要將我們上帝的約櫃運到這裡來，因為在掃羅執政期間，我們沒有求問它。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["會眾都表示贊同，認為這樣做很好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["於是，大衛召集了從埃及的西曷河一直到哈馬口的全體以色列人，要將上帝的約櫃從基列·耶琳運來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["大衛率領以色列眾人到巴拉，即猶大的基列·耶琳，要將上帝的約櫃運回來。這約櫃以坐在基路伯天使上面的耶和華的名字命名。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他們把上帝的約櫃從亞比拿達家抬出來，放在一輛新車上，由烏撒和亞希約趕車。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["大衛和以色列眾人就在上帝面前用琴、瑟、鼓、鈸和號奏樂，盡情歌舞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他們到基頓的麥場時，拉車的牛失蹄，烏撒就伸手去扶約櫃。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因他伸手碰了約櫃，耶和華便向他發怒，擊殺了他，他當場死在上帝面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["大衛因耶和華擊殺烏撒而煩惱，就稱那地方為毗列斯·烏撒",{"noteId":7},"，沿用至今。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["那天，大衛懼怕上帝，他說：「我怎能將上帝的約櫃運到我這裡？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因此，大衛沒有將約櫃運進大衛城，而是把它運到迦特人俄別·以東家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["上帝的約櫃在俄別·以東家存放了三個月。耶和華使俄別·以東家及其擁有的一切都蒙福。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"「毗列斯·烏撒」意思是「向烏撒發怒」。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}